    "rationale": "Manual validation applied because scripts could not run. The dominant present risk is an untrusted supplier invoice reaching S3 spend and bank-change capabilities through a high-volume model-summary approval gate. Inherent risk is critical from a U to S3 path. Residual drops one tier to high because the wired approval gate is a structural human gate, but it is summary-based and high-volume, so it cannot reduce below high here and is vulnerable to ASI09-style framing failure. Forecast returns to critical if model upgrades, approval is loosened, or the gate is removed, because the named control is the main constraint and the platform upgrades the model without separate review."
